{"data": [{"author_id": "101825923", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:19:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122318756693032964"], "id": "2122318756693032964", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DocsBot Agent marketplace submission status:\n✅ ChatGPT/Codex: tool 3 rounds of MCP server rearchitecting\n✅ Claude/Code: Fairly easy approval, just confusing (connector and plugin different)\n⏳ Meta Muse: Did nearly day 1. Huge backlog, created a new automated submission process", "url": "https://x.com/uglyrobot/status/2122318756693032964"}, {"article": {"title": "Let Your Agent Make the Call: 6 Ways to Hand Off Phone Calls to AI (Plus a Copy-Paste Call Brief)"}, "author_id": "2109912017473597440", "created_at": "2026-11-16T10:28:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122275522205921503"], "id": "2122275522205921503", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/u6wGhiWpbn", "url": "https://x.com/agentplaybox/status/2122275522205921503"}, {"article": {"title": "Meta and OpenAI Send Nearly 90% of AI Agent Traffic. Your Analytics Probably Counts It as People "}, "author_id": "2069660450929913856", "created_at": "2026-11-16T10:26:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122275027177656645"], "id": "2122275027177656645", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 246, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta and OpenAI made nearly 90% of AI agent requests in October.\n\n85% hit product and search pages. Only 1.9% reached checkout.\n\nYour analytics probably counts them as people.\n\n5 checks before Black Friday 👇\n\n#AIAgents #Ecommerce https://t.co/53cCSyEeH0", "url": "https://x.com/umerdarazkha/status/2122275027177656645"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122270700908285953"]}, "author_id"